Configurable on-screen message duration for Gothic 1, Gothic 2, and mods (The Chronicles of Myrtana: Archolos, etc.).

Allows you to comfortably read on-screen notifications (received/given items, potions, quest updates, experience notifications) without them disappearing too quickly.

[b]Features:[/b]
- Extends the on-screen display time for all messages to a configurable duration.
- Default duration is set to [b]10 seconds[/b].
- 100% Standalone Union plugin. Depends only on Union.

[b]Configuration:[/b]
Edit [b]zPrintScreenDuration.d[/b] to customize the duration in seconds:
[code]
// Configurable duration (in seconds) for on-screen messages:
const int z_PrintScreen_DurationSeconds = 10;
[/code]

